  "titulo": "Conque = so, therefore (colloquial)",
  "subtitulo": "Ya es tarde, conque apúrate. ¿Conque te vas?",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "Conque (one word) introduces a consequence, often followed by a command: Estás tosiendo, conque tómate el jarabe. At the start of a question or exclamation, it shows surprise: ¿Conque ya no tienes dinero? = So you're out of money? In Mexico, así que is far more common; conque sounds a bit old-fashioned or literary.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
