      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "fact",
            ", conque",
            "+ consequence (often a command)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "= **así que, por lo tanto**, but rarer and a bit old-fashioned in Mexico."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "At the start, with surprise: **¿Conque esas tenemos?** = _So that's how it is?_"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "One word: **conque**. **Con que** (two words) is **con** + **que**: **basta con que me avises**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**In Mexico** you'll mostly hear **así que** and **entonces**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **conque** = _so..._ with a raised finger."
        }
      ]
    },
